UMPOcc

This package is derived from ProOOD.
The Apache License, Version 2.0, supplied with that project is retained.
Existing copyright and attribution comments remain in their source files.

The modified research implementation adds multi-prototype modeling (UMPOF),
spatial OOD score calibration (PPSC), and supporting training/evaluation tools.
For this source release, configuration and prediction paths were made portable,
public configuration names and shell entry points were added, and documentation
was rewritten. Registry names remain compatible with the inherited model.

ProOOD builds on SGN and OpenMMLab. Files carrying upstream attribution retain
that attribution. The label preprocessing code credits LMSCNet and SSC in its
source comments. MobileStereoNet sources under preprocess/mobilestereonet/
retain their accompanying Apache-2.0 LICENSE and attribution comments.

SPIdepth is an external dependency of the optional SQL preprocessing tools;
its source and checkpoints are not bundled. Datasets and all model weights
must be obtained separately under their respective terms.
